# <%= projectName %>

Quarkus CLI walking skeleton (Kotlin) scaffolded by keel — hexagonal, mediator-driven.

## Layout

```
domain/
  kernel/      — Command, Handler, Mediator bases; depends on nothing
  contract/    — the public surface: GreetCommand (+ ports as they appear)
  core/        — RegistryMediator + the GreetCommand handler
application/
  cli/         — picocli + Quarkus: maps flags to commands, dispatches
                 via the mediator, and hosts the composition root
infrastructure/  — driven adapters (arrives with the first real port)
```

## Run

```sh
./gradlew :application:cli:quarkusDev
# or once built:
./gradlew :application:cli:run --args="hello --name World"
```

## Test

```sh
./gradlew test
```

## Build a native binary

```sh
./gradlew :application:cli:build -Dquarkus.package.type=native
```
